---
source: app/src/bin/nova/setup.rs
expression: shown(&facts)
---
install packages for bluetooth, peripherals, recording, screenshot, wallpaper (packages only in the AUR need paru or yay installed first):
    sudo pacman -S --needed bluez bluez-utils upower headsetcontrol gpu-screen-recorder grim wl-clipboard xdg-utils awww
create /home/me/.config/nova/config.toml
create /home/me/.config/nova/features.toml
write /home/me/.config/systemd/user/nova.service
write /home/me/.config/systemd/user/app-.service.d/nova.conf
reload systemd's units:
    systemctl --user daemon-reload
start novad with the graphical session:
    systemctl --user enable nova.service
write /home/me/.config/nova/niri.kdl
add to /home/me/.config/niri/config.kdl:
    include "/home/me/.config/nova/niri.kdl"
